OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785442291
OL,3,CHow much rain would it take to end a
OL,4,Cdrought in the UK?
OL,6,FThe UK is facing one of its most
OL,7,Fsignificant dry spells in decades,
OL,8,Fwith some areas experiencing their
OL,9,Flongest periods without a downpour for
OL,10,Faround 30 years.
OL,12,FAfter weeks of very little rainfall,
OL,13,Fsome locations are finally seeing a
OL,14,Ffew showery bursts today - the first
OL,15,Fin some places since mid-June.
OL,17,FHowever, this will not be enough to
OL,18,Fend drought conditions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
