OL,3,CHow much rain would it take to end a
OL,4,Cdrought in the UK?
OL,6,FWe need sustained, widespread rainfall
OL,7,Fover a prolonged period to properly
OL,8,Freplenish rivers, reservoirs and
OL,9,Fgroundwater levels.
OL,11,FWhat exactly defines a drought here in
OL,12,Fthe UK?
OL,14,FA drought is not simply defined by a
OL,15,Fcertain number of rain-free days.
OL,17,FIn the UK, drought is declared when
OL,18,Fthere is a prolonged period of below-
OL,19,Faverage rainfall that begins to affect
OL,20,Fwater resources, the environment,
OL,21,Fagriculture or other sectors.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
