CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785442291
OL,3,CHow much rain would it take to end a
OL,4,Cdrought in the UK?
OL,6,FExperts look at a range of factors,
OL,7,Fincluding rainfall totals, river
OL,8,Fflows, groundwater levels, reservoir
OL,9,Fstorage and soil moisture.
OL,11,FThe impact of the dry weather is also
OL,12,Fconsidered - for example, whether
OL,13,Fcrops are struggling, rivers are under
OL,14,Fpressure or water supplies are being
OL,15,Faffected.
OL,17,FHow dry has it been ` and why are more
OL,18,Fdroughts being declared?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
