PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785442291
OL,3,CHow much rain would it take to end a
OL,4,Cdrought in the UK?
OL,6,FHow much rain do we actually need to
OL,7,Fend the drought?
OL,9,FThere is no single amount of rainfall
OL,10,Fthat will instantly end a drought.
OL,12,FThe key is not just how much rain
OL,13,Ffalls, but where it falls and how
OL,14,Fconsistently it arrives.
OL,16,FA few showers today may bring
OL,17,Ftemporary relief, but they are
OL,18,Funlikely to make a major difference to
OL,19,Fthe wider drought situation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
