PN,30808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785442291
OL,3,CHow much rain would it take to end a
OL,4,Cdrought in the UK?
OL,6,FLooking ahead, the latest Met Office
OL,7,Fthree-month forecast for August,
OL,8,FSeptember and October indicates a
OL,9,Fhigher-than-normal probability of
OL,10,Fdrier-than-average conditions
OL,11,Fcontinuing for the period as a whole.
OL,13,FHowever, the chance of widespread
OL,14,Fwetter conditions becomes more likely
OL,15,Ftowards the end of that three-month
OL,16,Ftimeframe.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
