FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785442291
OL,3,CHow much rain would it take to end a
OL,4,Cdrought in the UK?
OL,6,FFor now, the focus remains on whether
OL,7,Fthe UK can see a sustained change in
OL,8,Fthe weather pattern - not just
OL,9,Fisolated showery bursts - to begin
OL,10,Frecovering from one of the most
OL,11,Fnotable dry spells in recent decades.
